33.035","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Heavy","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Normal Attack 4-Hit","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":"rowspan","interruptionResistance":"77.358","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Heavy","horizontalForce":"800","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Charged Attack","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":null,"text":"Charged Attack"},"type":{"span":null,"text":"0.5s"}},"interruptionResistance":"120","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Air","horizontalForce":"480","verticalForce":"600"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Plunging Attack Collision","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"25","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Low Plunge","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"100","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Heavy","horizontalForce":"800","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":true},{"name":"High Plunge","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"150","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Air","horizontalForce":"0","verticalForce":"800"},"bluntAttack":true}]},"1":{"skillId":10772,"type":0,"name":"雲臺團團降蘆菔","description":"請某位仙人特製的機關「月桂·拋擲型」上陣，幫助瑤瑤解決煩惱。\\n長按時將以不同的方式施放。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>長按</color>\\n進入瞄準狀態，調整投擲方向。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>月桂·拋擲型</color>\\n會投擲白玉蘿蔔，白玉蘿蔔會在命中角色或敵人時炸裂，對一定範圍內的敵人造成<color=#99FF88FF>草元素傷害</color>，並為其中的角色恢復生命值，回復量受益於瑤瑤的生命值上限；若未命中敵人或角色，白玉蘿蔔將會留在命中的位置，並在觸及角色或敵人時，或持續時間結束時炸裂。\\n月桂·拋擲型會依據附近的情況，選擇投擲白玉蘿蔔的目標：\\n·附近的角色如果生命值均高於70%，會向附近的一名敵人投擲；\\n·附近如果存在生命值低於或等於70%的角色，則會向附近場上生命值百分比最低的角色投擲。若附近沒有敵人，則在角色的生命值均高於70%、低於100%時，也會向角色投擲；否則會向周圍隨意投擲。\\n\\n同時至多存在2個月桂·拋擲型。\\n\\n<i>「蘿蔔上市，郎中無事！啊，這不是說蘿蔔治百病的意思，不過，多吃蘿蔔確實有好處！」</i>","descriptionBuff":null,"icon":"Skill_S_Yaoyao_01","promo